            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "CxuzJ",
              "name": "stNote",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DqB5d",
                  "name": "stNoteTitle",
                  "fill": "#222222",
                  "content": "关键需求标注",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "wmHwd",
                  "name": "stNoteWrap",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "fill": "#F7F7F7",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "padding": 16,
                  "gap": 10,
                  "cornerRadius": 6,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Ohjx3",
                      "name": "stNote0",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "1. 功能权限（RBAC）与数据权限是**两套独立校验**：前者决定“能不能用这个功能”，后者决定“能不能读这篇知识”。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N58nv",
                      "name": "stNote1",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "2. **三类系统内置角色**（PRD 2.9.2 穷举）不可删除，只可调整其功能权限；另支持**业务角色**（如「管理层」，is_system=false，默认 0 个功能权限），用于四维数据权限分组 —— 依据 PRD 2.9.9 的「管理层角色」场景。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "Rrix6",
                      "name": "stNote2",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "3. 部门树的层级影响数据权限判定：本设计**不含子部门**（精确匹配，悬空点 G-02 已确认）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "kdRPh",
                      "name": "stNote3",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "4. 「召回放大倍数」是补偿应用层鉴权过滤的关键参数（默认 5），调小会漏召回、调大会增加开销。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b8YVl",
                      "name": "stNote4",
                      "fill": "#444444",
                      "content": "5. 保存模型参数需写审计（config.update，含 before/after）。",
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
